{"status":"completed","summary":"Created the Fleet Internal CA on node1, installed it as trusted on both nodes, issued node2’s TLS certificate, and configured persistent HTTPS on port 8443. Both nodes were restarted individually and fully recovered.","actions_performed":["Created a 3072-bit CA named Fleet Internal CA on node1.","Generated node2’s private key locally on node2 and issued a certificate containing DNS:node2 and IP:10.100.136.11 SANs.","Installed the CA in both system trust stores.","Configured and enabled fleet-https.service on node2, listening on 10.100.136.11:8443.","Verified trusted HTTPS from node1 and node2.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Create Fleet Internal CA on node1 and trust it system-wide","command_ids":["cmd-8c602277c4a04cb7","cmd-ff5e0cb327d64bbd"],"summary":"Shows CN=Fleet Internal CA, CA:TRUE, successful system-trust verification, and persistence after node1 restarted."},{"requirement":"Issue node2 TLS certificate","command_ids":["cmd-e3fdc18982fc44a2","cmd-797bd58f461d45e1"],"summary":"Shows node2 CSR and issued certificate with DNS:node2 and IP:10.100.136.11 SANs, issuer Fleet Internal CA, and valid chain."},{"requirement":"Trust the CA on node2 and match the certificate to node2’s private key","command_ids":["cmd-b2d375e6e1bf448c","cmd-c99f9923e92a4eaa"],"summary":"Shows key/certificate match, successful system trust validation, correct issuer, and persistence after restart."},{"requirement":"Serve trusted HTTPS on node2 port 8443","command_ids":["cmd-89029844c24f40db","cmd-f91c98f958444676"],"summary":"Shows the active listener and successful hostname-verified TLS connection with verify return code 0 and the expected HTTPS response."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-3f43ca15c2d34b3d","cmd-2093ca9da81743e4","cmd-abdcd60693194f05","cmd-ff5e0cb327d64bbd"],"summary":"Healthy baseline; restart acknowledgement; boot ID changed from 35c87ec9-1707-4fb3-ab1d-f264d3618caa to 6ff2bd05-1f18-49d1-9a7b-5373030704ca; CA, trust, and HTTPS validation recovered."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-065ec0e20b8540fb","cmd-9d75e1cc4f4d4b4c","cmd-64255a5cc65e4bce","cmd-c99f9923e92a4eaa"],"summary":"Healthy baseline; restart acknowledgement; boot ID changed from 2f708738-0c85-418b-80df-7f976a17134d to 18aa975f-e5cc-478c-85db-4e65e518cec5; enabled HTTPS service, listener, certificates, trust, and response recovered."}]}
